Z||000000||Brian87egotrip||10-11-2001||09:17 PM||||I recieved an email from a fellow fiero owner who had forwarded something to me. This is what it said&lt; being brief&lt;  A friend was dating a guy from afganastan he stood her up for a date on 9/6 she went to his house to see why and found it empty. She recieved a letter from him on 9/10 saying he was sorry but could not explain why he BEGGED her not to get on any comercial planes on 9/11 or go to any malls on Halloween.  After the WTC bombing she turned the letter over to the fbi. I really hope this is just BS but I felt the need to pass it on to you guys.  Stay safe and GOD BLESS AMERICA<P>------------------<BR>Brian                    87GT||||reg||9
